header_vfinal:"Generi\u010Dki oglasi",pa_prompt_generic_ads_option_body_vfinal:"I dalje \u0107ete vidjeti oglase, ali \u0107e oni mo\u017Eda biti manje relevantni.",pa_prompt_bottom_line_text_vfinal:"To u bilo kojem trenutku mo\u017Eete a\u017Eurirati u postavkama oglasa.",pa_prompt_web_toast:"Odabrana je preferencija oglasa"}},hu:{translation:{pa_prompt_header_vfinal:"A hirdet\xe9sek megjelen\xedt\xe9s\xe9nek be\xe1ll\xedt\xe1sa",pa_prompt_placeholder_use_data_vfinal:"Engedd meg, hogy felhaszn\xe1ljuk az adataidat, \xe9s \xedgy relev\xe1nsabb hirdet\xe9seket jelen\xedts\xfcnk meg neked",pa_prompt_intro_paragraph_vfinal:". Ez seg\xedt, hogy a TikTok d\xedjmentes maradhasson. A k\xf6vetkez\u0151 oldalakon tov\xe1bbi inform\xe1ci\xf3kat tal\xe1lhatsz arr\xf3l is, hogyan v\xe9dj\xfck meg az adataidat: {privacy} \xe9s {cookie}.",pa_prompt_placeholder_privacy:"Adatv\xe9delem",pa_prompt_placeholder_cookie_policies:"Cookie ir\xe1nyelvek",pa_prompt_personalized_ads_option_header_and_button:"Szem\xe9lyre szabott hirdet\xe9sek",pa_prompt_personalized_ads_option_body_vfinal:"A hozz\xe1j\xe1rul\xe1sod alapj\xe1n hirdet\xe9seket jelen\xedt\xfcnk meg neked. A hirdet\xe9seket a TikTokon \xe9s azon k\xedv\xfcl v\xe9gzett tev\xe9kenys\xe9geid alapj\xe1n szem\xe9lyre szabjuk. A TikTokon k\xedv\xfcli tev\xe9kenys\xe9geidet csak akkor haszn\xe1ljuk fel, ha a k\xe9sz\xfcl\xe9keden enged\xe9lyezed a nyomon k\xf6vet\xe9st.",pa_prompt_select_button:"Kiv\xe1laszt\xe1s",pa_prompt_generic_ads_option_header_vfinal:"\xc1ltal\xe1nos hirdet\xe9sek",pa_prompt_generic_ads_option_body_vfinal:"Tov\xe1bbra is l\xe1tni fogsz hirdet\xe9seket, de kev\xe9sb\xe9 lesznek relev\xe1nsak.",pa_prompt_bottom_line_text_vfinal:"Ezt a hirdet\xe9si be\xe1ll\xedt\xe1sokban b\xe1rmikor m\xf3dos\xedthatod.",pa_prompt_web_toast:"Hirdet\xe9si preferencia kiv\xe1lasztva"}},it:{translation:{pa_prompt_header_vfinal:"Scegli la modalit\xe0 di visualizzazione degli annunci",pa_prompt_placeholder_use_data_vfinal:"Consentici di utilizzare i tuoi dati per mostrarti annunci pertinenti",pa_prompt_intro_paragraph_vfinal:". Questo \xe8 ci\xf2 che ci consente di mantenere TikTok gratuito. Inoltre, puoi scoprire come utilizziamo e proteggiamo i tuoi dati nelle nostre {privacy} e {cookie}.",pa_prompt_placeholder_privacy:"Privacy",pa_prompt_placeholder_cookie_policies:"Informativa sui cookie",pa_prompt_personalized_ads_option_header_and_button:"Annunci personalizzati",pa_prompt_personalized_ads_option_body_vfinal:"Ti mostreremo gli annunci una volta che avremo ottenuto il tuo consenso. Gli annunci mostrati saranno personalizzati in base alla tua attivit\xe0 dentro e fuori TikTok.  Utilizzeremo la tua attivit\xe0 fuori TikTok soltanto se abiliti il monitoraggio sul tuo dispositivo.",pa_prompt_select_button:"Seleziona",pa_prompt_generic_ads_option_header_vfinal:"Annunci generici",pa_prompt_generic_ads_option_body_vfinal:"Vedrai comunque gli annunci, ma potrebbero essere meno pertinenti per te.",pa_prompt_bottom_line_text_vfinal:"Puoi aggiornare questa opzione in qualsiasi momento nelle impostazioni degli annunci.",pa_prompt_web_toast:"Preferenza sugli annunci selezionata"}},lt:{translation:{pa_prompt_header_vfinal:"Pasirinkite, kaip rodomi skelbimai",pa_prompt_placeholder_use_data_vfinal:"Leiskite mums naudoti j\u016Bs\u0173 duomenis, kad gal\u0117tume jums rodyti aktualius skelbimus",pa_prompt_intro_paragraph_vfinal:". Tai padeda i\u0161laikyti \u201ETikTok\u201C nemokam\u0105. Taip pat galite su\u017Einoti, kaip mes naudojame ir saugome j\u016Bs\u0173 duomenis m\u016Bs\u0173 {privacy} ir {cookie}.",pa_prompt_placeholder_privacy:"Privatumas",pa_prompt_placeholder_cookie_policies:"Slapuk\u0173 politika",pa_prompt_personalized_ads_option_header_and_button:"Suasmeninti skelbimai",pa_prompt_personalized_ads_option_body_vfinal:"Jums sutinkant mes pateiksime jums skelbim\u0173. Rodomi skelbimai bus suasmeninti remiantis j\u016Bs\u0173 veikla \u201ETikTok\u201C ir kitur. Mes naudosime j\u016Bs\u0173 veikl\